From cc2b281315587f0ed1a5740d629809a50bb41af1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: stranger-the-unknown
 <81967554+stranger-the-unknown@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:05:09 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Unify analysis into one list and fix Android Stockfish via
 jniLibs (8.0.2)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause: asset extract+chmod into app support still fails Process.start
on Android 10+ (W^X / SELinux). Prefer jniLibs/<abi>/libstockfish.so in
nativeLibraryDir; keep assets extract as fallback. ensureAndroidStockfishBinary
runs before every engine start.

UI: single Analiz button and Son Analizler (sys_analysis); merge sys_deep/
sys_quick on load; deep-quality timings only; remove quick⇄deep review toggle.
